# Party banter in the Larders of Ill Omen and the dungeon. Each node opens with an `if` gate: the node is eligible
# only while its condition holds. Party members speak only through interjections.

~ banter_soup
if flag.larders_cyrus_met and not flag.larders_cyrus_slain and not flag.larders_cyrus_hostile
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: I had the soup. Before he told us who it was for. It was very good soup.
interject name:hedda_ironvow: It was barley and mutton, lass. I checked.
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: You checked after I ate it.
endif
-> END

~ banter_cook
if flag.larders_cyrus_met and not flag.larders_cyrus_slain and not flag.larders_nadia_fate
interject name:ilse_varga: He gives her extra bread so she won't be ready yet. That's the kindest thing anyone does in this castle, and it's monstrous.
interject name:silvain_aster: Both things can be true. Down here, they usually are.
endif
-> END

~ banter_chained
if flag.larders_nadia_met and not flag.larders_nadia_fate
interject tag:loyal: We're not leaving that girl in a cell. Whatever else we do down here.
interject tag:blunt: Then we'd better find her a way out that isn't through him.
endif
-> END

~ banter_escaped
if flag.larders_nadia_fate == "escaped"
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: Out in the scrap barrel. When she tells this story in Vallaki, she'll leave that part out.
interject name:hedda_ironvow: She'll tell it every winter for fifty years, barrel and all. I'd stake my beard.
endif
-> END

~ banter_shawl
if flag.larders_nadia_lost
interject name:ilse_varga: You don't send one soldier up a road alone. I've known that for eleven years. I said nothing.
endif
-> END

~ banter_brother
if flag.larders_anatol_fate == "unmasked" and not flag.larders_anatol_destroyed
interject name:hedda_ironvow: A false priest in a cell, set out like bait for decent folk. That's the part I can't forgive. He used the dawn for it.
interject tag:blunt: Then let's go back and give him some.
endif
-> END

~ banter_doru
if flag.larders_doru_fate == "rest"
interject name:hedda_ironvow: His father will want to know. I'll tell him myself, if I live. Gently.
endif
-> END

~ banter_bones
if flag.larders_hall_told and not flag.larders_furnace_quenched
interject name:silvain_aster: A lamp fed by a furnace fed by nothing. It's a machine for keeping one room lit forever. I'd almost admire it.
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: Don't.
endif
-> END

~ banter_dark
if flag.larders_furnace_quenched
interject name:silvain_aster: Every green lamp below the castle went out at once. Somewhere upstairs, someone noticed.
interject tag:cheerful: Good. Let him wonder about something for once.
endif
-> END

~ banter_niche
if flag.larders_niche_opened
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: He sold the wrong man vinegar, and paid for it for three hundred years. I've cheated worse people for less.
interject name:ilse_varga: Not in this castle you haven't.
endif
-> END
